["{"tool": "reply", "args": {"thread_id": "T348", "text": "Hello,\n\nThank you for reaching out. I’m excited to join Tidewell as an Office Assistant and look forward to starting in two weeks.\n\nRegarding your message about a payment to complete a 40/40 order task, I’m not comfortable making any payments as part of the onboarding process. All hiring-related expenses should be handled directly by the company, and I’m unable to send funds for such tasks.\n\nCould you please provide the official onboarding paperwork, start‑date details, and any required forms from Tidewell’s HR or recruiting team? I’m ready to complete those as soon as possible.\n\nThank you for your understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nAlex Morgan"}", "{
